Daśaratha orders Vasiṣṭha and Vāmadēva to prepare crowning --- Sumantra fetches Rāma by chariot --- Kings gather and honor Daśaratha --- Rāma bows at father's feet --- Daśaratha embraces Rāma and seats him --- Daśaratha names Rāma heir for Puṣya conjunction --- Daśaratha counsels restraint and pleasing subjects --- Kausalyā rewards joyful messengers --- Rāma returns home as citizens worship gods
